# The build context is frameworks/navree. BuildKit reads this file (named after
# the Dockerfile) instead of a .dockerignore.
#
# Allow-list: the manifest, the lock file, the source and the configuration.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!config

# Never needed inside the allowed directories either.
**/target
**/storage
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
